[2026-05-28T16:43:54+08:00][sql] UPDATE `cmf_portal_post`  SET `thumbnail` = 'portal/20260508/2807d80b2968c3fed8390d4012a4f032.jpg' , `post_content` = '
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;What is an overhead crane? Complete Procurement and Selection Guide&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: initial; font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Introduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;In factories, warehouses, or various processing workshops, the efficiency of material transportation directly affects production progress and is also related to daily operating expenses. When choosing indoor lifting equipment, people often come into contact with &lt;a href=&quot;/overhead-crane.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;overhead cranes&quot;&gt;overhead cranes&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;Some first-time buyers and factory management personnel are not clear about the construction principle of this equipment, nor do they know if their own site is suitable. This practical purchasing guide is explained in plain language, taking you through a comprehensive understanding of overhead cranes and helping you determine the crane that fits the on-site working conditions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#039;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; font-size: 20px;&#039;&gt;The meaning of overhead crane&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;Overhead crane, also commonly known as electric bridge EOT crane, is a fixed installation industrial lifting equipment that is installed at the top frame position of factories and warehouses. Different from ground mobile lifting equipment, it relies on the track laid by the factory columns and steel frames for operation, covering the entire indoor area without occupying the ground use space throughout the entire process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;The equipment is equipped with an &lt;a href=&quot;/Electric-Hoist.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;electric hoist&quot;&gt;electric hoist&lt;/a&gt;, a running trolley, and a walking transmission structure, which can independently complete the lifting and translation of heavy objects. It is also the most widely used and cost-effective lifting equipment in the field of indoor industrial material handling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260525/53731f53eb0efd329dc5849fa199f813.webp&quot; title=&quot;Overhead Traveling Crane.webp&quot; alt=&quot;Overhead Traveling Crane.webp&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core operating principle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;The operation mode of the bridge crane is simple and reliable. The main beam travels left and right along the top track, and the small car carried on it can move back and forth on the main beam, coupled with the vertical takeoff and landing operation of the hoist, covering the three-dimensional lifting range of the factory area in all directions. The device supports two operation modes: remote control and cab control, which are easy to operate and can meet the frequent lifting operation needs in the factory area.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;Mainstream classification of overhead cranes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;According to the structural style and actual usage scenarios, the mainstream types are &lt;a href=&quot;/Single-Girder-Overhead-Crane.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;single beam bridge cranes&quot;&gt;single beam bridge cranes&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;/double-girder-overhead-crane.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;double beam bridge cranes&quot;&gt;double beam bridge cranes&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Single girder overhead crane&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;The overall single main beam structure, lightweight body, simple structure, and affordable procurement cost. The conventional load-bearing range is 1 ton to 20 tons, suitable for small and medium-sized tonnage lifting operations, commonly used for daily material transportation in ordinary production workshops, warehouses, and processing assembly lines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260525/dc5a989b0c85f53f80ab77728025df60.webp&quot; title=&quot;single-girder-overhead-crane.webp&quot; alt=&quot;single-girder-overhead-crane.webp&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&#039;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures;&#039;&gt;Double &lt;strong style=&#039;font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;girder overhead crane&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;Double beam reinforced fuselage provides stronger load-bearing capacity, smoother operation, and longer equipment lifespan. It can undertake large tonnage and high load continuous operations, with a maximum lifting capacity of up to 100 tons, suitable for use in steel plants, heavy machinery processing, metallurgical workshops, and large factories.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260525/d2acf2becccb461b0404d5524d5cb8e9.webp&quot; title=&quot;Double girder Overhead Traveling Crane.webp&quot; alt=&quot;Double girder Overhead Traveling Crane.webp&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 20px; box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;Customized special models&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;Customized models are available for various complex and demanding work environments according to specific needs. &lt;a href=&quot;/Low-Headroom-Overhead-Crane.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Low clearance bridge cranes&quot;&gt;Low clearance bridge cranes&lt;/a&gt; are selected for areas with limited floor height; Flammable and explosive petrochemical plant areas are equipped with explosion-proof devices; The high-temperature smelting and metallurgical workshop is suitable for high-temperature resistant models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advantages of overhead crane&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;1. Do not occupy ground space&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;The equipment is suspended and the ground area is fully reserved for easy placement of production equipment and personnel movement, maximizing the utilization of the overall space in the factory area.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;2. There are no blind spots in the scope of the assignment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;It can span the entire span and length of the factory, and the entire factory area can be reached for lifting, avoiding the limitations of small lifting equipment operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;3. Stable, durable and worry free operation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;The whole machine is made of industrial steel, with strict quality standards for core components, and can withstand long-term uninterrupted operation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt; Smooth operation with low noise, minimal daily maintenance workload, effectively reducing losses caused by equipment failures and shutdowns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;4. Outstanding cost-effectiveness in comprehensive use&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;Compared to other heavy lifting equipment, the purchase cost is lower, the on-site installation process is simpler, and the service life is longer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt; Paired with comprehensive after-sales support, it is a cost-effective choice for long-term lifting operations in the factory area.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applicable industries and scenarios&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;Overhead crane has strong adaptability and is widely used in various industrial fields&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;1. Production workshop, assembly line, and goods storage warehouse;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;2. Steel smelting, metallurgical processing, and machinery manufacturing industries;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;3. Special operation areas for petrochemical and coal mining;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;4. Power engineering, railway infrastructure, and large-scale industrial projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practical reference points for purchasing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;Some overhead crane purchasers only compare prices when selecting, which can easily lead to equipment specifications and on-site working conditions not matching.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt; To select a suitable bridge crane, it is necessary to verify the height and span of the factory building, the required lifting tonnage, the frequency of daily operations, as well as the environmental conditions of the factory workshop such as temperature, dust, and explosion prevention on site.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#039;box-sizing: initial; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&#039;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/about.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;WEIHUA&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt;WEIHUA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: initial;&quot;&gt; have mature crane customization services that can tailor design solutions based on the actual situation of the factory area. This ensures that there is no waste of funds caused by redundant configurations, and that equipment performance meets production standards without delaying normal production operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
